Madame D's question column.
===========================

Q: Who is this Leclerk guy anyway, O Wise and All-Seeing Madame D?

A: This question is answered elsewhere in this issue, and does not crave
   my abilities.


Q: Is it true that Le'Clerk prefers Dwinnie's weenie to Brom's Bratwurst?

A: I truly hope that you saw the pictures from the mudparty. That would
   give you a clue. Besides, Leclerk claims the size is not important.


Q: Dear Madame D. I am a rather high wizard, and I have wondered for a
   long time: When will damned open? Please answer me, as I am bewildered.

A: Dear wizard. According to Damned's homepage the guild opened about a
   year ago. According to the responsible guild coder it will open when
   Nanny is ready for it.
   Well, well, at least the possible future guild head got his promotion to
   highwiz.


Q: Hmm I am wondering, those the admins try to demote as many ppl as
   possible? Like:
   Wiz Brom Yes! I got 1 more sucker You better hurry banshee Or i am going
   to win that toaster.
   Wiz Banshee damn i better acuse someone for multiplaying..
   Brom shouts: 10 more demotions to rank!
   ...I wonder if this is true? Please answer me Madame D

A: We asked Nanny's log expert, Bive, and he looked through the logs of
   shouts and the wizline for the last 4 years.
   He did not find any of the above-mentioned sentences, and we must
   therefore dismiss it all as a lie.


Q: Dear all-knowing Madame D, I am a low-level knight who recently
   purchased a portable CD player. I like to listen to music while I play,
   but I have faced a problem during the knight attacks.
   When I was listening to my Fugees CD, I came to the song "Killing me
   softly". Then orc king killed me, even if I think it was more brutal
   than soft.
   Later I listened to E-type, but when I came to "Free like a flying
   demon" the demon lord Xhudg came and killed me.
   Please Madame D, what can I do?

A: Dear knight, I recommend you to listen to Leila K. The music has the
   effect of scaring all orcs away at once. Please try next time you play.


